WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.253
This guide uses the running app with fictional training records.

5
00:00:04.253 --> 00:00:07.404
Camera, location and cloud responses are simulated.

9
00:00:07.404 --> 00:00:10.369
Sign in with your company username and password.

13
00:00:10.369 --> 00:00:13.643
The written guide includes every task and setup step.

17
00:00:14.443 --> 00:00:19.462
Open your invitation from N P I to create the company administrator account.

21
00:00:19.462 --> 00:00:24.018
After signing in, My subcontract shows your permitted contract sites.

25
00:00:24.018 --> 00:00:26.791
Ask N P I to add missing responsibilities.

29
00:00:26.791 --> 00:00:30.225
Your company manages its own workers and scheduling.

33
00:00:31.025 --> 00:00:33.410
Open My team and choose Invite workers.

37
00:00:33.410 --> 00:00:36.283
Create the company link and share it privately.

41
00:00:36.283 --> 00:00:39.646
Workers register themselves and wait for your approval.

45
00:00:39.646 --> 00:00:44.354
The link expires after seven days and allows up to one hundred registrations.

49
00:00:45.154 --> 00:00:48.955
Check Pending workers and verify who belongs to your company.

53
00:00:48.955 --> 00:00:52.382
Approve genuine registrations or reject unknown people.

57
00:00:52.382 --> 00:00:54.376
This grants account access only.

61
00:00:54.376 --> 00:00:56.868
Work hours still need a separate review.

65
00:00:56.868 --> 00:01:01.230
Reset passwords or pause access from the account register when needed.

69
00:01:02.030 --> 00:01:03.375
Create a work order.

73
00:01:03.375 --> 00:01:06.535
Choose the permitted contract site and service.

77
00:01:06.535 --> 00:01:10.906
Enter the work area, instructions, date, equipment and checklist.

81
00:01:10.906 --> 00:01:13.327
Select the approved company workers.

85
00:01:13.327 --> 00:01:18.236
Save the assignment; N P I can see who assigned it and every team member.

89
00:01:19.036 --> 00:01:21.644
For regular jobs, use Repeat assignment.

93
00:01:21.644 --> 00:01:25.100
Choose the first date, interval and number of copies.

97
00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.644
Review the schedule before creating it.

101
00:01:27.644 --> 00:01:30.056
Unstarted crew changes need a reason.

105
00:01:30.056 --> 00:01:35.665
After work starts, preserve the crew and create a separate job for additional workers.

109
00:01:36.465 --> 00:01:41.750
In Settings, enter your company recipients and the urgent acknowledgement deadline.

113
00:01:41.750 --> 00:01:43.852
N P I has its own recipient list.

117
00:01:43.852 --> 00:01:46.654
Send a test email and check the email queue.

121
00:01:46.654 --> 00:01:51.876
Queued is not sent; delivery needs the configured sender and scheduled dispatcher.

125
00:01:52.676 --> 00:01:56.928
Open the issue, acknowledge it and choose a responsible administrator.

129
00:01:56.928 --> 00:01:58.872
Add comments as work progresses.

133
00:01:58.872 --> 00:02:00.938
A resolution needs an explanation.

137
00:02:00.938 --> 00:02:04.766
Urgent issues that remain open are escalated by the dispatcher.

141
00:02:04.766 --> 00:02:07.621
The reporter can see the status and resolution.

145
00:02:08.421 --> 00:02:09.803
Open submitted work.

149
00:02:09.803 --> 00:02:13.119
Compare each worker’s recorded and claimed time.

153
00:02:13.119 --> 00:02:17.195
Inspect both G P S events, accuracy, checklist and outcome.

157
00:02:17.195 --> 00:02:21.409
Scroll to compare Before, Progress, After and Issue evidence.

161
00:02:21.409 --> 00:02:25.900
Clicking a photo opens a viewing copy and its unchanged original.

165
00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:30.862
Choose Approve and forward to N P I only after checking the record.

169
00:02:30.862 --> 00:02:35.521
Incomplete work or an evidence exception requires explicit acknowledgement.

173
00:02:35.521 --> 00:02:39.931
If anything needs correction, return it with a specific reason instead.

177
00:02:40.731 --> 00:02:47.966
Check activity and exceptions for overdue work, long open shifts, location concerns and hour differences.

181
00:02:47.966 --> 00:02:52.789
Filter reports by date, company or site and export the loaded records.

185
00:02:52.789 --> 00:02:56.303
Use the paginated work register to find older jobs.

189
00:02:56.303 --> 00:02:58.163
Sign out on shared devices.
